# Shift Plan

Before changing the calendar, read `AGENTS.md`. It is the product handoff: what the page is, how to publish, and the rules already in force.

When a change alters behavior, publish steps, or those rules, update `AGENTS.md` in the same change. Keep `README.md` consistent with it.

Edit `coverage-calendar.html`, copy it to `index.html`, and commit only `index.html` for calendar changes. Do not commit `coverage-calendar.html` or `serve-calendar.py`. Do not print the lead PIN.
